<title>USA: BOXING-MOORER STOPS BOTHA TO RETAIN IBF HEAVYWEIGHT TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-MOORER STOPS BOTHA TO RETAIN IBF HEAVYWEIGHT TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Michael Moorer stopped South African Francois Botha 18 seconds into the 12th and final round to retain his International Boxing Federation heavyweight championship on Saturday.</p>
</text>
